4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:22,167
This fictional household has two linked
tasks. Maya was going to pack a library

5
00:00:22,167 --> 00:00:30,917
bag at two thirty, then give a ride at
three. Her cancellation affects both. The

6
00:00:30,917 --> 00:00:35,000
